  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0: Internal architecture refactoring with handler delegation pattern. All format parsers now delegate to specialized handlers (T42Handler, VBIHandler, ANCHandler, TSHandler, MXFHandler) implementing ILineFormatHandler and IPacketFormatHandler interfaces. Improved code organization, state encapsulation, and maintainability while maintaining 100% backward compatibility. Zero breaking changes.",
